### T243 — Calendar-of-days panel with crossed-out dates (P14 T04) ◆ — OWED #108
- Tier: **DESCRIBED — OWED #108**
- Mechanics: a rounded panel holds a grid of day numerals; most are struck through with diagonal slashes, two are ringed, and dashed drop-lines connect two crossed dates to a timeline below whose labels are also struck out; a second panel with empty checkboxes joins it. Draw-on order: grid → strikes → drop-lines → timeline labels — "after such-and-such a date it will work out" is refuted by the calendar itself. (Named draw-on order — OWED.)
- Feeds: diagram · transition — P14 @ ≈13–27 s — ev/020-calendar-days.jpg, ev/026-calendar-tasks-crossout.jpg

